.TH HATCH\-DEP "1" "August 2024" "" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
.B hatch\ dep
\(en Manage environment dependencies
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B hatch\ dep
.RI [ OPTIONS ]
.I COMMAND
.RI [ ARGS ]...
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-h\fR, \fB\-\-help
